 Start!",milestone_100_desc:"You have reached your first milestone of 100 DH today.",milestone_250_title:"Great Work!",milestone_250_desc:"You have crossed the 250 DH activity mark.",milestone_500_title:"Goal Achieved!",milestone_500_desc:"Daily target of 500 DH completed.",milestone_750_title:"Outstanding Performance!",milestone_750_desc:"You are on fire! 750 DH accumulated today.",milestone_1000_title:"Champion of the Day!",milestone_1000_desc:"Congratulations! You are the champion of the day with 1000 DH.",continue_driving:"Continue Driving",view_income_details:"View Income Details"}},494,[]);
